## Thumbnail

![Thumbnail](thumbnail.jpg)

## Description

I love Wispr Flow, but it's $12/month and still doesn't give my agent the visual context it needs.  So I built BetterVoice: press the hotkey, speak, and circle anything on screen.   It transcribes locally and captures the exact visual context your agent needs.  Open-source https://t.co/TKftLsGbun

